==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*3 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam a bunch of meatshields to protect your backliners, while you quickly kill Sinner Snaches and hope their Death Surges don't kill too many of your important units. Units with Long Distance work to hit H.Nah, like [[Polevaulter Cat]] and [[Medalist Cat]], while units that can deal with the Sinner Snaches include [[Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Crazed Dragon Cat]].

